<title>USA: AEI, IBM in 3-year logistics pact.</title>
<headline>AEI, IBM in 3-year logistics pact.</headline>
<dateline>DARIEN, Connecticut 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air Express International and IBM Corp said they have agreed to a three year contract covering air freight and customs brokerage service which AEI is to provide across part of the computer group's global network.</p>
<p>AEI said it will manage IBM's airfreight business between all countries in the Asia-Pacific region and Australia-New Zealand, as well as all business between the Asia-Pacific region and South America, Africa and India.</p>
<p>AEI also said it received a significant customs brokerage contract to clear IBM shipments across the Canada-US border. --Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
